---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Graphite Polystyrene Insulation — Superior Thermal Performance" description="House insulation with graphite polystyrene — 20% better lambda coefficient. Thinner layer, better insulation. ETICS installation Krakow and Malopolska." schemaType="services" locale="en">
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-16 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900"></div></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-red-600"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8"><a href="/en" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/en/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a><span>/</span><span class="text-orange-400">Graphite Polystyrene Insulation</span></nav>
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 mb-6"><span class="text-orange-400 text-sm font-semibold">Premium Insulation</span></div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Graphite Polystyrene <span class="text-gradient">Insulation</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Graphite polystyrene delivers 20% better thermal insulation compared to standard white polystyrene. Thinner layer, same effect — ideal for modern homes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">What is <span class="text-gradient">graphite polystyrene</span>?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Graphite polystyrene (EPS 031/032) is an enhanced version of standard polystyrene, enriched with graphite particles. These microscopic additives reflect infrared radiation within the material, significantly reducing heat transfer. Graphite polystyrene achieves a thermal conductivity of lambda = 0.031 W/(m-K), while standard white polystyrene has lambda = 0.040 W/(m-K).</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">In practice, 15 cm of graphite polystyrene provides better insulation than 20 cm of white. This is particularly important when insulation thickness is limited — e.g., narrow sidewalks, eaves, or property boundaries.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Installation uses the ETICS system (wet render method). We use certified systems from renowned manufacturers: Swisspor, Termo Organika, Austrotherm, ensuring full system warranty and compliance with technical requirements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Insulate your home with <span class="text-gradient">graphite polystyrene</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact us for a free quote. We will advise on insulation thickness selection and help calculate heating savings.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">Free insulation quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+48515156233" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-colors">Call: 515-156-233</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
